# One line ending everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic: clang-format rewrites CRLF to LF, so with mixed endings the
# formatter's verdict depended on the platform the repository was checked out on -
# green on Windows, red on Linux, for the same commit. The formatter now states LF
# explicitly (see .clang-format), and git stores and checks out LF so that the two
# agree.
* text=auto eol=lf
